<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Donnelley &amp; Sons.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Donnelley &amp; Sons.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities confirmed it initiated coverage of R.R. Donnelley &amp; Sons with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Donnelley &amp; Sons closed Friday at 37-3/4.</p>
